{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 141,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.5599365234375,
        121.0513916015625,
        98.2879409790039
      ],
      "text": "Safety",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.2994384765625,
        513.3916015625,
        118.65093994140625
      ],
      "text": "Gastric aspiration is generally not an aerosol-generating procedure. As young children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.29595947265625,
        513.3684692382812,
        134.6474609375
      ],
      "text": "are also at low risk of transmitting infection, gastric aspiration can be considered a low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.29248046875,
        513.3685302734375,
        150.64398193359375
      ],
      "text": "risk procedure for TB transmission and can safely be performed at the child’s bedside or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.28900146484375,
        226.07537841796875,
        166.6405029296875
      ],
      "text": "in a routine procedure room.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        179.12794494628906,
        204.03939819335938,
        198.64395141601562
      ],
      "text": "Sputum induction",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        212.56390380859375,
        155.04739379882812,
        229.29190063476562
      ],
      "text": "Background",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        236.30340576171875,
        510.17156982421875,
        249.6549072265625
      ],
      "text": "It is important to note that, unlike gastric aspiration, sputum induction is an aerosol-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        252.2999267578125,
        513.4030151367188,
        265.65142822265625
      ],
      "text": "generating procedure. Where possible, therefore, this procedure should be performed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        268.29644775390625,
        513.4374389648438,
        281.64794921875
      ],
      "text": "in an isolation room that has adequate infection control precautions (negative pressure,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        284.29296875,
        432.66143798828125,
        297.64447021484375
      ],
      "text": "ultraviolet light (turned on when room is not in use) and extractor fan).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        308.79949951171875,
        513.4950561523438,
        322.1510009765625
      ],
      "text": "Sputum induction is regarded as a low-risk procedure for the child to be evaluated for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        324.7959899902344,
        513.3916625976562,
        338.1474914550781
      ],
      "text": "TB. The very few adverse events that have been reported include coughing spells, mild",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        340.79248046875,
        513.4144897460938,
        354.14398193359375
      ],
      "text": "wheezing and nosebleeds. Recent studies have shown that this procedure can safely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        356.7889709472656,
        513.4833984375,
        370.1404724121094
      ],
      "text": "be performed even in young infants (2), although staff will need to have specialized",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        372.78546142578125,
        413.07696533203125,
        386.136962890625
      ],
      "text": "training and equipment to perform this procedure in such patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        397.2919616699219,
        513.4028930664062,
        410.6434631347656
      ],
      "text": "Examine children in advance to ensure they are well enough to undergo the procedure.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        413.2884521484375,
        487.42462158203125,
        426.63995361328125
      ],
      "text": "Children with the following characteristics should not undergo sputum induction:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        435.75970458984375,
        513.5833129882812,
        449.69171142578125
      ],
      "text": "inadequate fasting: if a child has not been fasting for at least 3 hours,  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.7394027709961,
        450.1596984863281,
        381.4753723144531,
        464.0917053222656
      ],
      "text": "postpone the procedure until the appropriate time;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        470.5597229003906,
        493.9273681640625,
        484.4917297363281
      ],
      "text": "severe respiratory distress (including rapid breathing, wheezing, hypoxia); -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        490.959716796875,
        176.75540161132812,
        504.8917236328125
      ],
      "text": "intubation; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        511.3597412109375,
        513.5474243164062,
        525.291748046875
      ],
      "text": "bleeding: low platelet count, bleeding tendency, severe nosebleeds  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.7394027709961,
        525.7597045898438,
        356.6354064941406,
        539.6917114257812
      ],
      "text": "(symptomatic or platelet count <50/ml blood);",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        546.15966796875,
        279.8833923339844,
        560.0916748046875
      ],
      "text": "reduced level of consciousness; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        566.5596923828125,
        461.911376953125,
        580.49169921875
      ],
      "text": "history of significant asthma (diagnosed and treated by a clinician). -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0394058227539,
        590.6797485351562,
        144.3914031982422,
        607.4077758789062
      ],
      "text": "Procedure",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        614.4152221679688,
        480.76593017578125,
        627.7667236328125
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Administer a bronchodilator (e.g. salbutamol) to reduce the risk of wheezing.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        636.4147338867188,
        513.4375610351562,
        649.7662353515625
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Administer nebulized hypertonic saline (3% NaCl) for 15 minutes or until 5 ml of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        652.4111938476562,
        288.6238708496094,
        665.7626953125
      ],
      "text": "solution have been fully administered.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        674.4107055664062,
        487.3094787597656,
        687.76220703125
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Carry out chest physiotherapy if necessary; this is useful to mobilize secretions.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        696.4102172851562,
        513.46044921875,
        709.76171875
      ],
      "text": "4.\t For older children who are able to expectorate, follow procedures as described under",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        712.4066772460938,
        306.7134094238281,
        725.7581787109375
      ],
      "text": "“Expectoration” above to collect sputum.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        734.4061889648438,
        505.4678649902344,
        747.7576904296875
      ],
      "text": "5.\t For children who are unable to expectorate (e.g. young children), carry out either:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        754.3597412109375,
        428.359375,
        768.291748046875
      ],
      "text": "suction of the nasal passages to remove nasal secretions; or  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        774.7598266601562,
        411.43939208984375,
        788.6918334960938
      ],
      "text": "nasopharyngeal aspiration to collect a suitable specimen. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        8.642800331115723,
        805.8439331054688,
        42.002803802490234,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "122",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}